flowchart LR
    CONFIG[Validated YAML] --> FP[Canonical configuration fingerprint]
    FP --> SEEDS[Semantic deterministic seed streams]
    SEEDS --> RUN[Typed rollout and update records]
    RUN --> CKPT[Checkpoint plus checksum]
    CKPT --> FREEZE[Frozen candidate metadata]
    FREEZE --> PREREG[Byte-fingerprinted preregistration]
    PREREG --> LOCK[Atomic test-consumption lock]
    LOCK --> REPORT[Markdown and machine-readable final report]
    REPORT --> FIGURES[Deterministic JSON-derived figures]
